<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n529" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁγ-ιστεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>perform sacred rites,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				759d
			</span></i>: c.acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερουργίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.40
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα ἄλλα -εύεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.231
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be holy, live purely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅστις.. βιοτὰν ἁ. καὶ θιασεύεται
					ψυχάν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					74
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be sacred,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				6.20.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.13.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>purify,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φόνου χεῖρας</span> Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				10.6.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>deem holy:</i>—
				Pass.
			, of places, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.3.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.40
			</span></i>.</div>
